{"3961300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jettison", "steam_appid": 3961300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jettison is a <strong>first-person survival horror</strong> game where you wake up aboard a <strong>spaceship</strong> and must use your wits to survive and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is inspired by games like <strong>Granny</strong> and <strong>Alien: Isolation</strong>. Typical completion time is less than an hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate <strong>corridors</strong>, and various <strong>rooms</strong> to find the items you need to escape, all whilst avoiding a stalking threat...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/5b683b642b64477008a7e1935f66dd0c.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"The medlab room.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/dff214ee951bc7f9a597a14d7cb37719.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"The crew sleeping pods.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/f23d3ff07af6d7c842b063bd3f200982.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"The offices room.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to find <strong>key cards</strong> for certain doors...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/dc40af31e8e4253e1f38c5be6e9d30bd.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"A purple keycard being used on a keypad.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...A <strong>battery pack </strong>to provide power to some areas...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/d7adcd3c648369b45f3441a8b7dd57f4.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"A portable battery plugged into a wall socket.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And you will have to interact with <strong>terminals</strong> to enable some new pathways.  You may even need to use <strong>security cameras</strong> to see where the creature is...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/04dd8f6aee33f7d1716b0e768cb65729.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"A computer terminal that shows security cameras.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other items available for you, such as a <strong>welder</strong> to seal doors, a <strong>backpack</strong> to help you carry more items and a <strong>flashlight</strong> to help navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/60bf3d1bdbc47d3ce7e4f161248ed4f5.poster.avif?t=1766057697\" aria-label=\"A welder sealing a door closed.\" width=842 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/60bf3d1bdbc47d3ce7e4f161248ed4f5.webm?t=1766057697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/60bf3d1bdbc47d3ce7e4f161248ed4f5.mp4?t=1766057697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay alert</strong>!  The creature stalking you is <u><strong>extremely dangerous</strong></u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jettison is a <strong>first-person survival horror</strong> game where you wake up aboard a <strong>spaceship</strong> and must use your wits to survive and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is inspired by games like <strong>Granny</strong> and <strong>Alien: Isolation</strong>. Typical completion time is less than an hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate <strong>corridors</strong>, and various <strong>rooms</strong> to find the items you need to escape, all whilst avoiding a stalking threat...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/5b683b642b64477008a7e1935f66dd0c.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"The medlab room.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/dff214ee951bc7f9a597a14d7cb37719.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"The crew sleeping pods.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961300/extras/f23d3ff07af6d7c842b063bd3f200982.avif?t=1766057697\" alt=\"The offices room.\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to find <strong>key cards</strong> for certain doors...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai